# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CODEOWNERS — AForce OS monorepo
#
# Syntax: <glob>  <owner1> [<owner2> ...]
# The LAST matching pattern wins. More-specific globs go LOWER in the file.
#
# Replace the placeholder handles below with real GitHub usernames or
# `@org/team-slug` references before enabling branch protection. Until you
# do, GitHub will silently treat patterns as un-owned.
#
# Recommended GitHub setup once handles are filled in:
#   Settings → Branches → Add rule for `main`:
#     • Require pull request before merging
#     • Require review from Code Owners
#     • Require approvals: 1 (bump to 2 for the OWNER-only paths below)
#     • Require status checks to pass (typecheck, test)
#     • Require linear history
#     • Do not allow bypassing the above settings
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Default: every file needs the owner's sign-off unless overridden below.
*                                       @OWNER_HANDLE

# ── Mobile app (Expo) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
artifacts/aforce-os/                    @OWNER_HANDLE @MOBILE_LEAD_HANDLE
artifacts/aforce-os/**/*.ts             @MOBILE_LEAD_HANDLE
artifacts/aforce-os/**/*.tsx            @MOBILE_LEAD_HANDLE

# ── Backend (API server + DB) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
artifacts/api-server/                   @OWNER_HANDLE @BACKEND_LEAD_HANDLE
artifacts/api-server/**/*.ts            @BACKEND_LEAD_HANDLE
lib/db/                                 @OWNER_HANDLE @BACKEND_LEAD_HANDLE
lib/db/migrations/                      @OWNER_HANDLE @BACKEND_LEAD_HANDLE

# ── API contract (binding on both mobile & server) ───────────────────────────
